<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/activity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In xAPI, an Activity is something an Actor interacts with or experiences and that can serve as the object of a tracked Statement. Activities can represent instruction, performance, experiences, resources, events, or even physical or virtual objects." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/activity/versions/1> .
