<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/activity> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Activities are the primary way xAPI identifies what an experience was about, allowing the same model to describe learning across courses, simulations, work, media, and real-world events." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/activity/versions/1> .
